    "sections": {
        "description": "<p>This plugin loads the Rek.ai scripts into WordPress. It can be used to configure search autocomplete, and it provides Gutenberg blocks to load recommendations and Questions &amp; Answers.</p>\n<p>This plugin requires a Rek.ai account to use.</p>\n<p>Plugin source code: https://github.com/JCO-Digital/rekai-wordpress</p>\n<h4>Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Loads Rek.ai scripts into WordPress.</li>\n<li>A recommendations block.</li>\n<li>A Q&amp;A block.</li>\n<li>Loads and configures search autocomplete.</li>\n<li>Provides test mode.</li>\n</ul>\n",
        "installation": "<ol>\n<li>Install the plugin using the Plugins menu in WordPress. Alternatively, you can upload the plugin files manually.</li>\n<li>Activate the plugin in the Plugins menu in WordPress.</li>\n<li>Configure your Rek.ai script key in the Rek.ai WordPress settings.</li>\n<li>Enable the features you want to use in the Rek.ai WordPress settings.</li>\n<li>Use the provided Gutenberg blocks.</li>\n</ol>\n"
    },
    "short_description": "Integrates Rek.ai into WordPress.",
    "description": "<p>This plugin loads the Rek.ai scripts into WordPress. It can be used to configure search autocomplete, and it provides Gutenberg blocks to load recommendations and Questions &amp; Answers.</p>\n<p>This plugin requires a Rek.ai account to use.</p>\n<p>Plugin source code: https://github.com/JCO-Digital/rekai-wordpress</p>\n<h4>Features</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Loads Rek.ai scripts into WordPress.</li>\n<li>A recommendations block.</li>\n<li>A Q&amp;A block.</li>\n<li>Loads and configures search autocomplete.</li>\n<li>Provides test mode.</li>\n</ul>\n",
